["<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">卒</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>毕业；士兵；死亡；突然；结束</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソツ・シュツ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">そっ.する・お.える・お.わる・ついに・にわか</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">卒業</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">そつぎょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">毕业；完成课程；超越；摆脱；离开；退出；辞去</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">何卒</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">なにとぞ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">请；恳请；拜托了；烦请；务必；一定；无论如何</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">略</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>省略；粗略；侵占；谋略；大致</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リャク</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ほぼ・はぶ.く・おか.す・おさ.める・はかりごと・はか.る</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">省略</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうりゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">省略；略去；缩写；节略；缩短（如名称）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">略す</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りゃくす</span><span class=\"k-wz\">缩写；简化；缩短；省略；去掉；夺取；捕获；偷取</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">概略</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">がいりゃく</span><span class=\"k-wz\">概略；摘要；要旨；简而言之</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">承</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>接受；承认；同意；继承；获悉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ショウ・ジョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">うけたまわ.る・う.ける</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">承知</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうち</span><span class=\"k-wz\">知晓；知悉；接受；同意；答应；应允；遵从；认可；原谅；宽恕；包容</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">承認</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょうにん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">批准</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">承る</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">うけたまわる</span><span class=\"k-wz\">听到；被告知；知道；接受（订单）；承担；应允；接受（预约等）</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">順</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>顺序；轮次；顺利；顺从</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジュン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">順</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">顺序；顺位；排序；顺从的；温顺的；柔顺的；驯良的</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">順調</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">顺利；进展良好；不错；可以</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">順番</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じゅんばん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">顺序；轮次</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">岩</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>岩石；巨石；悬崖</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ガン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">いわ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">岩</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いわ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">岩石；巨石；险峰；峭壁</span