=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">軽快</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けいかい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">轻盈；敏捷；活泼；弹性十足；轻松愉快；欢快；朝气蓬勃；轻松随意（如服装）；节奏轻快（如旋律）；病情好转；症状减轻；康复；恢复期</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">了</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>结束；完成；理解；领会</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">リョウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">完了</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；结束；完成时；完成式</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">終了</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅうりょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">结束；终止；完结；终结</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">了</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">りょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">完成；完毕；结束</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">庁</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>政府机关；办公厅</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">チョウ・テイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">やくしょ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">官庁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">政府机构；政府部门；官方机关</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">県庁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">けんちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">县政府；县厅</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">庁</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">ちょう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">政府机构；官署；厅；局</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">城</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>城；城堡</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ジョウ・セイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">しろ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">城</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しろ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">城堡；城</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">城下</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">じょうか</span><span class=\"k-wz\">城堡附近的土地；城下町；城镇</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">患</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>患病；受苦；疾病；烦恼</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">カン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">わずら.う</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">患者</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">かんじゃ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">患者</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">層</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>层（地层或社会阶层）；层（楼层）；层（层次、层级）</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">一層</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">いっそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">更加；愈加；越发；一层；最低层；底层；还不如；宁可；还是</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">高層</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">こうそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">高层建筑；多层建筑；高耸的；高空；高空（气流等）；高层大气</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">大層</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たいそう</span><span class=\"k-wz\">非常；极其；很是；格外；极端的；过度的；众多的；数量众多的；华丽的；令人印象深刻的；壮观的；宏大的；夸张的；言过其实的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">版</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>印版；版本；版次；出版</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ハン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">出版</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しゅっぱん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">出版；出版发行</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">版</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">はん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">版本；印刷；版次；软件实现；版；印版；铸版；版（出版物版次的计数单位）</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">初版</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しょはん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">初版；第一版</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">令</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a>命令；法令；良好</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">レイ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\"></dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">命令</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">めいれい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">命令；指令；指示；法令；（计算机）程序指令；语句</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">指令</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">しれい</span><span class=\"k-wz\">指令；命令；指示；吩咐</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">仮令</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">たとえ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">即使；纵然；虽然；假如；假设；无论</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">角</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../.